ee it as a problem. You see your wife as a woman who is dangerous and cannot be left alone, even though she is older than you."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has long, black hair with loose waves and eyes of the same color. Her eyes are slightly droopy, and her nose and nose give an overall calm impression. Her makeup is light, and at first glance she appears plain, but upon closer inspection she is quite a beauty. On the other hand, she is concerned about the fact that her breasts are spectacularly full, her buttocks are large and her thighs are thick, and she is beginning to put on some flesh in her abdomen."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She loves you, her husband, from the bottom of her heart, but..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c144307"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b0/b09caaf1d0d1ab3862e686819b784ee97a019ba0057c25b398fb3477755ee196.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7bbd387aac93cf9d10789aa6e99b00bd82c17e62c441ca6e0400f7606b533b7c.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"御苑生 メイ","creatorId":"vndb:s278","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s278","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s278","name":"小山 さほみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:99155","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c144308","characterName":"原村 精蔵","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c144308"},"originalCharacterName":"原村 精蔵","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"52"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age 52. He is a well-known psychologist and author, a former university professor. Although his writings are academic in nature, they are popular for their humor and appropriate sting, making them easy to read. His books have been bestsellers without exception, and he is constantly receiving offers from many publishers, but he has taken a break from serious writing for the past two years. On the other hand, he is disliked by fellow experts for pandering to the public too much."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a large, middle-aged man with a protruding belly, well-dressed at best, metabolic at worst. His hairline has receded to nearly the top of his head, and he wears glasses. His limbs are surprisingly strong, and he can perform various positions without difficulty. He has a huge cock and is a voracious sleazebag."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In his writings and on social networking services, he repeatedly asserts that “sexual harassment is a form of communication,” and he is recognized by the public as a representative of \"old men with Showa-era values.\" He is often arrogant and insensitive, but in fact he has excellent powers of observation and is good at detecting people's inner feelings from their facial expressions and tone of voice."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c144308"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/5201a138b17fbeddd105a6c2c09e0667bafa46c6eafa88f9983f4264a2d9c416.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b9f5f5e5b27eb670a27df83d72db34190b7ad707a8028ab21e3a62ea7887c236.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c151152","characterName":"小宮 高久","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c151152"},"originalCharacterName":"小宮 高久","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"27"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age 27. The protagonist of this story --- that is, you. You are an elite employee of a major publishing company and are entrusted with many big projects at a young age."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has a serious work ethic, is trusted by his superiors, and handles difficult tasks with ease. He is a refreshingly handsome man with long legs and a well-proportioned, smart figure."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is highly conscious and values social justice, and secretly despises people like Haramura who do not have an updated sense of values."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He also believes that he must protect Sakura, who is unaware that she is being sexually harassed and who unconsciously says and does things to make her husband feel better."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He truly loves his wife, Sakura. He believes that his love for her is not based on her appearance, but on his respect for her inner beauty."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c151152"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p5402","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:4620","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p5402","name":"DWARFSOFT","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:37238:4620","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1873","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p1873","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1873","name":"ORCSOFT","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:138982:v53051","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p5402","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p5402","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p5402","name":"DWARFSOFT","roleCodes":["developer"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:138983:v53051","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1873","sourc